# Emeq Hub × DataForSEO: organische SERP (serp/google/organic/live/advanced)
#
# Setup: zie consumer/domain-overview.http en README.md.
# Betaalde call, afgerekend per 10 resultaten: depth (1-200, default 10)
# bepaalt de prijs. load_async_ai_overview=1 kost extra.

@baseUrl = http://hub.emeq.test:8092
@token = {{$dotenv EMEQ_HUB_PAT}}
@accountId = 47

### SERP top 10, defaults location_code 2528 (NL) en language_code nl
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/serp-organic?keyword=theorie+examen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### Top 20 op mobiel, inclusief AI Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/serp-organic?keyword=theorie+examen&depth=20&device=mobile&load_async_ai_overview=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### depth boven 200 → 422 (validatie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/serp-organic?keyword=theorie+examen&depth=201
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### Zonder keyword → 422 (validatie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/serp-organic
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}
